# Frontend dependencies. The API image builds with the repo root as its
# context, so without this it ships apps/web/node_modules — 531 MB of
# Linux/macOS-specific binaries (workerd, esbuild, lightningcss) that the
# Python image has no use for. Matters most on a remote builder like Dokploy,
# where the whole context crosses the network.
node_modules

# Local dev state that must never bake into an image.
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-wal
*.sqlite-shm
**/data_cache/
reports/
